  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Energy Roadmap Implementation Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment supports Tonga&apos;s Energy Roadmap (TERM 2010-2020) and TERMPlus (2021-2035) goals and renewable energy targets, with a focus on reducing dependence on fossil fuels/diesel for power generation, particularly in remote, outer islands. Infrastructure upgrades are also ensuring a safer and climate resilient power network. The investment covers contributions to the Outer Island Renewable Energy project (in partnership with the Asian Development Bank) and budget support to Tonga Power Limited (through Government of Tonga) to deliver the Nuku&apos;alofa Network Upgrade Project.</narrative>
  </description>
